category: Net
build-depends: cygport libQt5Core-devel
sdesc: "Simple DNS implementation (utilities)"
ldesc: "JDNS is a simple DNS implementation that can perform normal DNS queries of any
record type (notably SRV), as well as Multicast DNS queries and advertising.
Multicast support is based on Jeremie Miller's 'mdnsd' implementation."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/psi-im/jdns
license: MIT
